WEBVTT

00:42:54.816 --> 00:43:00.435
The data that I looked at shows that
about half of couplings are a cross-type,

00:43:00.459 --> 00:43:02.840
but it feels to me, just
walking around the world,

00:43:02.864 --> 00:43:04.662
like it's much more common than that.

00:43:04.686 --> 00:43:07.044
But anyway, I was going to say that

00:43:07.068 --> 00:43:09.317
one place that the difference
shows up for us

00:43:09.341 --> 00:43:12.965
in a way that you might not think about,
but I think really matters,

00:43:12.989 --> 00:43:17.318
is: How do you express enthusiasm?

00:43:17.342 --> 00:43:24.214
So, my husband has this amazing, really
delightful way of expressing enthusiasm

00:43:24.238 --> 00:43:25.778
about whatever happens.

00:43:25.802 --> 00:43:30.449
My best example of it
is when I first met him,